		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(9)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>Consists of&#160;12,000 ordinary shares, and (ii)&#160;30,658 options to purchase ordinary shares that are currently exercisable or will be exercisable within 60&#160;days from May&#160;25, 2023.</p>
